Subject: [PATCH 15/17] debug: refit-only mode for layouts too small to train

NRL_DEBUG_REFIT_ONLY=<eps> makes the Megatron worker's train run the
forward pass only and then scale every weight by 1 + eps (and back on the
next call), so each step still ends with a refit of changed weights while
vLLM generates, without the optimizer step the 4-node debug layout cannot
hold. Off unless the variable is set.
